---
description: Select a fresh surface that will exercise the changed behavior.
args:
  goal: string
  builds: AgenticBuildPlan
returns: AgenticCanarySurface
---
Use fresh-chat-panel for chat boot, visible capability exposure, or product negotiation through the panel. Use fresh-agent for worker prompt or tool behavior, native agent execution, or durable channel behavior. Consider the runnable units and the requested observation when both client and agent units rebuild.
